					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="game-tabber noexcerpt"><div class="game-tab" style="border: 2px solid var(--wiki-accent-color--hover); border-bottom: none;"><a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slay the Spire</a></div> <div class="game-tab"><a href="/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Monsters" title="Slay the Spire 2:Monsters">Slay the Spire 2</a></div></div>
<div class="ambox" style="--ambox-color: red;"><div class="ambox-icon metadata"><img alt="" src="/images/thumb/GremlinNob.png/42px-GremlinNob.png?deef85" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="42" height="48" srcset="/images/thumb/GremlinNob.png/62px-GremlinNob.png?deef85 1.5x, /images/thumb/GremlinNob.png/83px-GremlinNob.png?deef85 2x" data-file-width="433" data-file-height="499" /></div><div class="ambox-content"><p class="ambox-title">WARNING!</p><p class="ambox-text"><i>This page is under construction. Information may be wrong or incomplete.</i></p></div></div>
<p>Monsters are the normal Enemies of Slay the Spire. When these encounters are beaten, they drop a <a href="/wiki/Cards" title="Cards">Card Reward</a>, 10-20 <a href="/wiki/Mechanics#Gold" title="Mechanics">Gold</a>, and <a href="/wiki/Potions" title="Potions">sometimes a Potion</a>.
</p>
