<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Ascension_Modifiers">Ascension Modifiers</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Ascension Modifiers" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Ascension Modifiers"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="2" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">2</span></sup></span>: Normal Enemies deal more damage.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="7" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">7</span></sup></span>: Normal Enemies have more health and will sometimes gain more <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="17" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">Ascension</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">17</span></sup></span>: Normal Enemies have more challenging movesets and abilities.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Rules_of_Monster_Encounters">Rules of Monster Encounters</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Rules of Monster Encounters" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Rules of Monster Encounters"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li>The first 2 monster encounters (3 for Act 1) are randomly selected from an "Easy Pool", while the rest of the fights for that Act are randomly selected from a "Hard Pool".
<ul><li>In Act 1, you can never face these as your first "Hard Pool" combat depending on your 3rd "Easy Pool"
<ul><li>3 <a href="/wiki/Louses" title="Louses">Louses</a> after 2 <a href="/wiki/Louses" title="Louses">Louses</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Swarm of Slimes</a> or <a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Large Slime</a> after 2 <a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Slimes</a></li>
<li><b>Exordium Thugs</b> after <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Looter" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Thieves#Looter" title="Thieves"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Thieves#Looter" title="Thieves">Looter</a></span></li>
<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Red Slaver" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slavers#Red_Slaver" title="Slavers"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slavers#Red_Slaver" title="Slavers">Red Slaver</a></span> or <b>Exordium Thugs</b> after <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Blue Slaver" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slavers#Blue_Slaver" title="Slavers"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slavers#Blue_Slaver" title="Slavers">Blue Slaver</a></span></li></ul></li>
<li>In Act 3, you can never face <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Darkling" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Darkling#Darkling" title="Darkling"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Darkling#Darkling" title="Darkling">3 Darklings</a></span> ("Hard Pool") after <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Darkling" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Darkling#Darkling" title="Darkling"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Darkling#Darkling" title="Darkling">3 Darklings</a></span> ("Easy Pool"). These are identical fights.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li>The same monster encounter cannot be fought again in the next 2 monster encounters (that is, 3 consecutive monster encounters can never contain 2 identical fights).</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Act_1:_Exordium">Act 1: Exordium</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Act 1: Exordium" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Monsters?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Act 1: Exordium"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
